course: dictionary
lesson: 13887
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the sentence tells you which one is meant. «The museum showed a kris with a wavy blade and a carved wooden handle.» Clues like museum, blade and handle show that a kris is an object, a short dagger.
explain: Now read this: «Kris was late for school, so he ran all the way.» Kris has a capital letter in the middle of the sentence and is used like a person's name. That is a clue that it is a proper noun, the name of a person.
explain: Always ask: does this word fit as a thing, or as a person? Put your meaning into the sentence and check it still makes sense. A dagger does not fit in «Kris was late», so the name meaning is right there.
fact: A kris is a short dagger from Malaysia, Indonesia and nearby lands.
fact: Many krises have a wavy blade, and they are both traditional weapons and works of art.
fact: A kris can be passed down in a family, and skilled smiths make them with patterned metal and carved handles.
fact: The Indonesian kris is on UNESCO's list of the world's intangible cultural heritage.
fact: Kris is also a name, a short form of names like Kristopher, Kristina or Kristen.
exercise: «The museum showed a kris with a wavy blade.» What is a kris? | A kind of boat | A small cat from Malaysia | A plant that grows in hot countries | *A short dagger from Southeast Asia
exercise: «Kris was late for school, so he ran all the way.» Is Kris a thing or a person here? | A type of food | A weather word | A dagger | *A person's name
exercise: Which spelling of the dagger word is also in the dictionary? | crisp | *keris | knife | kiss
test: «The smith polished the kris until the patterns shone.» What is the kris in this sentence? | *A dagger with a patterned blade | A kind of bread | A friend called Kris | A river boat
test: «Kris and Kristina went to the park together.» Which word is a person's name? | together | *Kristina | went | park
exam: In which sentence does kris mean a dagger? | Kris is short for Kristopher. | Kris waved hello from the gate. | *The old kris had a wavy blade and a carved handle. | Kris and I are in the same class.
